OL,3,GNEWSAUK budget leaves NI underfunded,
OL,4,AO'Dowd says
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland's public funding has
OL,7,Fworsened relative to the rest of the UK
OL,8,Fas a result of the Westminster budget,
OL,9,FStormont's finance minister has
OL,10,Fclaimed.
OL,12,FJohn O'Dowd said the Treasury's figures
OL,13,Fshow that NI will now be funded below
OL,14,Fits objective "level of need" next year
OL,15,Fand the year after.
OL,17,FNeeds-based funding recognises that it
OL,18,Fcosts more to deliver public services
OL,19,Fin some parts of the UK compared to
OL,20,Fothers.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
