OL,3,GNEWSAUK budget leaves NI underfunded,
OL,4,AO'Dowd says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Secretary of State Sir Chris Bryant
OL,7,Fhas offered #1.5bn over the next three
OL,8,Fyears and said if Stormont ministers
OL,9,Faccept this, that will take funding
OL,10,Fcomfortably above the level of need.
